# Goal
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped[] waypoints  # Array of waypoints to include in the path
bool consider_altitude                 # Whether to consider altitude in planning

---
# Result
bool success                           # Whether the path planning succeeded
nav_msgs/Path path                     # Planned path connecting all waypoints
string message                         # Optional message for debugging or failure

---
# Feedback
float32 progress                       # Progress of the path computation (0.0 to 1.0)
